  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 180°C (350°F).",
    "In a large bowl, combine the bake mix, Uruguayan cheese, and beaten eggs.",
    "Mix well until a dough forms.",
    "Add the sliced pepperoni and chorizo to the dough and mix until well combined.",
    "Transfer the dough to a baking dish and top with sour cream.",
    "Sprinkle chopped parsley on top for garnish.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Bake in the preheated oven for 25-30 minutes, or until golden brown.",
    "Remove from oven and let cool for 5 minutes before serving."
